## Upgrading Kubernetes

The `kubernetes_version` argument controls the component image tags in the generated configuration. It does **not** trigger a Kubernetes upgrade on its own. To upgrade Kubernetes, change `talos_cluster.kubernetes_version`, which runs Talos's `upgrade-k8s` procedure.

Keep `kubernetes_version` here in sync with `talos_cluster.kubernetes_version` so nodes added later (scale-up) bootstrap at the correct version. See [`talos_cluster`](../resources/cluster.md) for details.

